{"content":[{"c":["UZZAH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. Son of Abinadab who was killed while accompanying the cart that carried the ark of the covenant when it was returned from the Philistines (",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.6.1-8","r":"2Sam.6.1-8","rawR":"2Sam.6.1-8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.6.1-8","value":"2Sam.6.1-8"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Sm 6:1-8"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.13.7-11","r":"1Chr.13.7-11","rawR":"1Chr.13.7-11","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.13.7-11","value":"1Chr.13.7-11"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 13:7-11"},"). He was struck dead by the Lord because he took hold of the ark while trying to steady it, thereby violating the instructions of ",{"href":"?bref=Num.4.15","r":"Num.4.15","rawR":"Num.4.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.4.15","value":"Num.4.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Numbers 4:15"},". Uzzah’s brother, Ahio, was apparently leading the oxen while Uzzah walked alongside. As a result of the incident, David renamed the site Perez-uzzah (“the breaking forth against Uzzah”) and left the ark at the home of Obed-edom."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. Levite from the clan of Merari who is listed as the son of Shimei and the father of Shimea (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.6.29","r":"1Chr.6.29","rawR":"1Chr.6.29","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.6.29","value":"1Chr.6.29"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 6:29"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Uzzah","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Sm 6:1-8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Sam.6.1-8","rawQueryValue":"2Sam.6.1-8","sourceRefExact":"2Sam.6.1-8"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 13:7-11","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.13.7-11","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.13.7-11","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.13.7-11"},{"anchorText":"Numbers 4:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.4.15","rawQueryValue":"Num.4.15","sourceRefExact":"Num.4.15"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 6:29","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.6.29","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.6.29","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.6.29"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"8a90508b93891649f454be10e62ccc5c464175deeb0543699c3998579088b60e","sourceItemName":"Uzzah","sourceItemOrder":38,"sourceMember":"Articles/U.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Uzzah","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Uzzah","title":"Uzzah","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}